oxrok: warn: oxrok::drivers::atten_pps3xxx: CH1, CH2, CH3 from on to off, ocp_enabled from on to off, channel_config from Series to Independent. A frame sets everything and the device cannot report its setpoints, so what this run did not set goes to 0: CH1 5.00 V 0.000 A, CH2 0.00 V 0.000 A, CH3 0.00 V 0.000 A.
